CHEAP HINT#5

THERE ARE SOME AREAS WHICH REQUIRE A CERTAIN AMOUNT OF SKILL TO
GET TO OR TO UNDERSTAND. THE REGISTERED VERSION USES ALL THE
SKILL FUNCTIONS (INCLUDING THE SPECIAL) WHILE THE UNREGISTERED
USES THE FOLLOWING:

TREK - SOME AREAS REQUIRE HIGH SKILLS IN TREKING TO GET TO. AMONG THESE
       SPECIAL AREAS ARE "SOME" MOUNTAIN SQUARES AND VEGITATION AREAS.

RIDING - EACH LEVEL OF MOUNT BECOMES PROGRESSIVELY MORE DIFFICULT TO
       RIDE. THEREFORE THEY EACH REQUIRE A CERTAIN SKILL TO MASTER.

LANGUAGE - NOT EVERY MONSTER SPEAKS OR WRITES IN ENGLISH. THERE ARE
       3 LEVELS OF LANGUAGE DIFFICULTY. THIS SKILL IS MOST USEFULL.

CLIMBING - SOME SQUARES REQUIRE A HIGH LEVEL OF CLIMBING TO GET OVER
       WHILE OTHERS REQUIRE A *ROPE OR LOW LEVEL OF CLIMBING SKILL.

* THE ROPE DOES NOT APPEAR IN YOUR BACKPACK WHEN BOUGHT SO DON'T WORRY.